    {
      "id": "B73fVrzNvO-e5oTg8rDmr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3318.449149603592,
      "y": 2912.3840648866094,
      "width": 953.774169921875,
      "height": 252.83066488368428,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 615324519,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 1303293543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784468619448,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\nA planning agent is an AI agent that does not immediately jump to \nanswering or acting — instead, \nit first creates a structured plan of what needs to be done, \nand then executes that plan step-by-step.",
      "fontSize": 28.894933129563917,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n\nA planning agent is an AI agent that does not immediately jump to \nanswering or acting — instead, \nit first creates a structured plan of what needs to be done, \nand then executes that plan step-by-step.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
